          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "Addition December 2017:\nThe variable 'gender' was missing from earlier versions. This has been corrected in the version of December 2017. The depositor deposited the .sav file, DANS converted it to .por and .dta for the benefit of STATA users and for durability purposes.\n\nAddition September 2015:\n\nThe depositor recently discovered an error which had happened during conversion in the 2006 data file: the UK and NZ were not in the list of countries defined anymore.\n\nTherefore, a new and better version of ICSEY has been uploaded, 'ICSEY distribution file 2015.sav'.\n\nBecause of durability and usability purposes DANS converted this file into:\n- 'ICSEY distribution file 2015.por' and\n- 'ICSEY distribution file 2015.dta'\n\nAll 3 files have been uploaded into this dataset September 16, 2015."
          },
